    {
      "key": "t1b25910375855f79",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Physical gold trading involves purchasing and owning actual gold bars, coins or jewellery. Gold CFD trading involves speculating on gold price movements without owning the physical metal. CFDs may involve leverage and carry significant financial risks.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-factors-influence-gold-and-silver-prices-in-the-global-market#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-factors-influence-gold-and-silver-prices-in-the-global-market"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">实物黄金交易涉及购买和拥有实际的金条、金币或珠宝。黄金差价合约交易涉及在不拥有实物金属的情况下对黄金价格走势进行投机。差价合约可能涉及杠杆并带来重大财务风险。</span>"
    },
